    heading: "set-up-your-project-1",
    content: "Since Apple does not support capturing the screen in the main process of the app, you create a separate extension for the screen sharing stream. You use the iOS native `ReplayKit` framework in the extension to record the screen, and then send the screen sharing stream to the main process."
